sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Player (user)
  participant G as :Game
  participant S as :ClimateCardSquare
  participant K as :CardDeck
  participant C as c : ClimateCard
  participant P as p : Player
  participant M as :ClimateMeter
  G->>S: landOn(p, g)
  S->>K: draw()
  opt draw pile empty
    K->>K: reshuffle()
  end
  K-->>S: c
  S->>C: resolve(p, g)
  C-->>U: show card text
  alt c is a QuizCard
    U->>C: answer i
    C->>C: checkAnswer(i)
    opt answer correct
      C->>P: addGP(2)
    end
  else c is a ChoiceCard
    U->>C: choose A or B
    C->>C: applyOption(choice)
    C->>P: receive(m) / pay(m) / addGP(n)
    C->>M: adjust(delta)
  else c is an EventCard
    C->>P: receive(m) / pay(m)
  end
  Note over P: pay() makes p bankrupt if money would go below 0
  C-->>U: show fact and source
